  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is incident on a metal plate with work function <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Phi\"></span>, electrons are emitted from the surface of the plate.</p>\n<p>What is the maximum speed of the emitted electrons?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2(hc -  \\Phi \\lambda)}{\\lambda m_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2hc -  \\Phi \\lambda}{\\lambda m_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2(hc -  \\Phi)}{\\lambda m_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2hc -  \\Phi}{\\lambda m_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
